# Pull Requests — Review Playbook

Created: 2026-02-02 05:37 UTC  
Last reviewed: 2026-02-02 05:37 UTC

## Responding to Review
- Reply to each actionable comment (even if “done in <commit>”).
- Prefer small follow-up commits; squash later if desired.
- If you disagree, explain tradeoffs and propose an alternative.

## Keeping Review Fast
- Keep PRs small and narrative-driven.
- Avoid mixing refactors with behavior changes unless necessary.
- Add targeted tests for the bug/feature.

## Suggested “Review Notes” Section
If reviewers frequently ask the same questions, include a short section:
- assumptions
- edge cases
- rollout plan
- telemetry/alerts to watch

## PR Creation via `gh` (Optional)
```sh
gh pr create --fill
gh pr view --web
```

